All mandatory declarations under Rule 6 shall be —
(a) in English or Hindi;
(b) legible and clear;
(c) indelible (not capable of being erased under ordinary conditions of handling);
(d) not obscured by design, illustration or another printed matter;
(e) printed in colour that provides adequate contrast with the background.

Embossed declarations without a contrasting colour fill are not acceptable as a substitute for printed text under normal retail lighting conditions.
